      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for phodav",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for phodav fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in phodav:\n\n- CVE-2026-114417: Path traversal in WebDAV MOVE/COPY via encoded slashes in Destination header [bsc#1289865]\n- CVE-2026-114418: Authentication bypass in PUT request handling via libsoup3 status override [bsc#1289866]\n- CVE-2026-114419: Chezdav digest authentication accepts any password for known users [bsc#1289867]\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
